      "review_description": "Easy contact from Paul and his team around the product and best set up for our house and usage. Once agreed and paid the installer turned up on one of the hottest days so far this year and got straight into it. Polite and industrious. Just a brilliant clean install with great communication. Left the place spotless and very gracious with their  hints around best use of the system. The follow up service saw the SEBSS team arrive a few days after the install to check everything was installed as needed and working correctly and we were aware of all of the intricacies around the best items to be using in the house when the solar system was at it's most productive.My biggest concern was due to the remoteness of our home, we may not receive the service we would have received if we were in the CBD, we could not have been more wrong. I would recommend the team at SEBSS to anyone.",
